WEBVTT

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:07.890
They want to apply to be 
opening artists at the Triple S...

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:11.650
The Triple S is a big, international event.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:17.670
It's natural to enter 
totally exceptional artists.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:19.990
But more importantly...

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:24.530
The Cross-Unit groups have work already.

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:30.420
Let's put them to work.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.030
The first stage of the 
Cross-Unit project will be...

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:29.330
Mr. Ittoki and Mr. Shinomiya.

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:35.380
You two will perform in a rock musical!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:38.120
What? A rock musical?

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.510
A stage performance?

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.970
That's right!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:46.410
We've received a direct offer 
from Isurugi Gen!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.960
Isurugi Gen?

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:49.980
Who is he?

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:57.940
He's a prodigal director 
who works on Broadway.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.360
A prodigal director, huh?

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.240
A direct offer...

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:10.800
Naturally, Miss Nanami, you will 
compose the main theme of the show.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:12.330
Yes, sir.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.370
A musical with songs by Haru-chan?

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.780
That sounds wonderful.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.050
Sounds great.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.550
With Nanami's songs, it's bound to be great.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:24.010
It's a rocking and rolling musical.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.310
I have high hopes for you!

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:28.210
I'll do my best.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:37.540
Read the script carefully 
and get a firm grasp of your roles.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:39.770
Yes, sir.

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:40.810
Understood.

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.080
A rock musical, huh?

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.610
I'm excited.

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:50.250
Yes. We'll get to sing a lot of songs.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.760
I play guitar in a few scenes, too.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.280
My character plays the viola.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:58.000
I see.

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:04.340
That's why it's called 
<i>Two Princes: A String and Bow Concerto</i>.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:08.880
When two princes learn 
their kingdoms will go to war,

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:12.960
they stop the fighting 
with the power of music.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.990
Natsuki and I play the princes.

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.900
I can't believe we're princes.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.590
It's a little embarrassing.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.950
That's not true at all.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:26.530
You'll both make wonderful princes.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.510
Thanks, Nanami.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.000
I'll do my best.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.560
Okay!

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:35.880
Let's read through the script in my room.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.250
Let's prepare for the first day of rehearsal.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:44.530
I'll do my best to write a song 
that's perfect for the two princes.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:05:00.360
Didn't we become friends through music?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.290
That's ancient history.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:03.830
I've forgotten all about it.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.410
Don't lie to me!

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:06.860
There's no way you forgot!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.830
You never change.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.560
You haven't changed, either.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.000
What proof do you have?

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:17.880
You still have that guitar.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:25.090
That's...

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:28.840
We're still those boys who loved music!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.340
But I—

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:47.860
Um...

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:48.900
We...

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.010
Let us try it again!

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.530
That's enough for today.

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:54.200
What?

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.830
Do better next time.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.580
I expect more from you.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:02.010
Good work!

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.630
Let's wrap up!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.370
Don't let it get you down.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:12.810
Yeah, Isurugi-san's always like that.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:17.070
You guys looked a little stiff.

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:18.770
You need to relax.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:20.860
Good work.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:22.300
Good work.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.230
Good work...

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:36.330
What a shock!

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.710
I can't believe they cut 
rehearsal short because of us.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:44.390
We really inconvenienced everyone.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.640
This is just a guess...

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:51.020
But we probably didn't have 
a firm grasp of our roles.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.890
Yeah, it's hard.

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.310
What's wrong?

00:06:57.880 --> 00:06:59.860
You look depressed.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.070
Guys...

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:03.900
Weren't you rehearsing for the rock musical?

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.720
Did something happen?

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:11.450
I see.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:15.060
That's why even milady looks depressed, too.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.380
What kind of roles are you playing?

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:19.660
Um...

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:23.680
My role is "an intellectual 
and emotionally subdued prince

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.380
who sometimes comes off as cold."

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:32.800
And I'm "a hot-blooded and chivalrous prince 
who always tackles challenges head on."

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.010
Those roles...

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:39.040
They're rather different 
from how you normally act.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:39.980
You're right.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:46.060
I don't know how to play 
a hot-blooded prince.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:49.310
I'm not sure how to play my role, either.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:53.520
Well, Ikki certainly isn't the cool type,

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:56.520
and Shinomin's not exactly 
hot-blooded, either.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.330
Cool and hot-blooded, huh?

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:06.460
Sounds like Tokiya and Syo.

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:18.040
Whoops...

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:32.050
Yuck!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.770
What are you doing?

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:43.130
So you tried to copy me?

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:47.930
Yeah. I was wondering 
what it's like to be cool...

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.660
Unbelievable.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:54.450
Perhaps you should read your script instead.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:56.900
But I memorized all my lines.

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:01.730
I don't think you can just copy someone.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:04.170
Then what should I do?

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:07.790
That's something you must 
discover for yourself.

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:19.760
Ryuya-sensei's so awesome.

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:20.680
Right?

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:24.610
He's a real hot-blooded and awesome man.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:32.330
This is... manliness...

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.590
What'd you think of that last scene?

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:43.700
Didn't it light a fire in you?

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.370
Yes.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:49.370
He charged up the rocks on his horse 
and jumped into the middle of his enemies.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.580
It was awesome!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.390
Yes.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.030
Now you're getting it.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:11:01.080
Yes. The horse's eyes were so round and cute.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:03.750
Hey! You're looking at the wrong thing!

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.100
What?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:07.610
Didn't you see all the other passionate scenes?

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.050
Um...

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.440
You don't get it...

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:15.520
I know Ryuya-sensei is awesome, but...

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:19.210
If you understand that much, 
why not give it a shot?

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:19.990
Okay.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:27.450
Hey! Don't forget about me!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.400
Nice.

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.220
Don't you want to taste my fist?

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:33.510
That's it.

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:36.230
I'll take you all on!

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:38.180
Good.

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:41.050
You'd make a perfect "Prince of Fighting."

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.010
Yeah.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:46.450
Huh? Something's not right.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.100
That's the wrong prince.

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:00.860
I see.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.150
Sounds rough.

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.650
But it's okay.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:07.940
What? Why?

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.080
I'm worried.

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.720
They're doing their best.

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:13.500
Yeah.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:18.530
I know they can do it.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:20.390
Huh.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.390
I see.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.620
So I'd better focus on my own work.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:30.220
Your music will be fine.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.780
I can attest to that.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.100
Thanks, Tomo-chan.

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:19.140
Good work.

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:43.710
You're overacting.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.850
Huh? We're...

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:47.050
Overacting?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:48.680
Um...

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:52.200
Try acting more like yourselves.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.860
Like...

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:01.540
...ourselves...

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:11.950
Didn't we become friends through music?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.210
That's ancient history.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.210
They're working hard.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.050
Their director's Isurugi Gen-san?

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:19.940
Yeah.

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:22.880
He put me through the wringer once.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.320
Really?

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:29.220
He must be a really tough director, then.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:35.200
At their level, there's nothing they can do.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:36.840
But...

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:38.890
With music, we can...

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.610
Otoyan and Nattsun are having a tough time.

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:45.730
This is stupid.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.650
Nice, nice.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.290
They're so young.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.080
Ittoki-kun, Shinomiya-san.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.400
Nanami.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.430
Haru-chan.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:32.720
I've been thinking about you for a while now.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:34.120
What?

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:39.200
Wondering what color you are.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.080
Our...

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:43.590
Color?

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:45.130
Yes.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:54.550
Ittoki-kun's color is like this.

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:01.150
This is... me?

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:09.060
Shinomiya-san's color is like this.

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:14.590
This is... me?

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:38.200
I'm trying to express 
your charm through music.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.270
Give me more time.

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:49.480
I'll compose a song that 
will draw out your strengths.

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:51.500
Nanami.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.220
Haru-chan.

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:55.090
It's okay.

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:59.460
You'll both make wonderful princes.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.410
Our sound...

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:12.880
Our color...

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.930
That's how Nanami sees it.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:20.210
She surprised me.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:24.880
But that was definitely your sound.

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:28.900
And that sound captured you perfectly.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:34.690
She said it'd be okay.

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:39.410
When Haru-chan says it, 
it really does seem that way.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.290
Be ourselves, huh?

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:53.000
What does it mean to be ourselves?

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:58.450
Well, you're always 
smiling and nice, I guess.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:02.890
You're always positive and full of energy.

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:08.350
You're always considerate of 
STARISH's members and fans.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:12.730
You're always pulling 
STARISH to greater heights.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:19.610
All right!

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:22.590
Let's start rehearsing all over again!

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:26.160
That sounds like you.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:27.550
Like me?

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:30.540
Yes. It sounds just like you.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:32.960
You think so?

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:35.920
Yes. Let's do our best together.

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:42.210
Fires are springing up all over the city.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:44.930
We were too late.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:48.600
You're not going to charge 
forward like you always do?

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.570
What?

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:54.840
You're the one who said 
he wanted to stop the fighting.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.260
Yeah, and I'll do it!

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:02.890
But the fighting will reach this place soon.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:08.010
Do you really think we 
can stop the war alone?

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:10.670
We have to try.

00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:14.150
You're so...

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:17.980
Let's go.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.080
Do you have a plan?

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:22.800
You showed me...

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:23.860
What?

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:27.110
The power of music!

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:47.080
I'll play like my life depends on it.

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:51.830
What will you do?

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.300
What will I do?

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:58.570
That's obvious.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:02.430
I'll use my music to move their hearts!

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:47.860
You were both wonderful princes.

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:51.080
Thanks to your song.

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:55.080
Your song was wonderful.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:21:59.400
What?

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:02.290
Um...

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:05.170
Come on, Nanami.

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:09.340
Let's go home.

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.570
Ittoki-kun, Shinomiya-san.

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:18.540
Okay.

00:24:06.690 --> 00:24:08.090
I missed you.

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:09.990
I want to hold you tight.

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:10.820
Uta Pri!
